<title>USA: HMI Industries names Mark Kirk CFO.</title>
<headline>HMI Industries names Mark Kirk CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>HMI Industries Inc said effective immediately, Mark Kirk has been appointed chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>The company said it also named Carl Young as vice president of administration and general counsel.</p>
<p>The company said Ivan Winfield will remain chairman of the finance committee of its board of directors.</p>
<p>Kirk was recently CFO of Anchor Glass Container Corp.</p>
